  "briefing": {
    "title": "THE ASH COURT",
    "story": [
      "Halex rules from a fortified court cut into the northern glass-flats — the",
      "nerve centre that signed Cauterize and every order before it. Break it and",
      "the Directorate on Aether Prime loses its head.",
      "",
      "SERA VANE: \"No more holding, no more running. We go to the man himself. Corr",
      "takes the west approach; you take the throat. Kill the command, Warden — the",
      "rest is just cleanup and grief.\""
    ],
    "objectives": [
      "Destroy the Directorate forward command (their Construction Yard)"
    ]
  },
  "debrief": {
    "win": [
      "The Ash Court caves in on itself, and Halex's signal cuts to static. His army",
      "still stands — but leaderless, and afraid. One stronghold left, and the man",
      "who called a planet a tumor is inside it.",
      "CORR: \"West approach is clear. Whatever's left of the Directorate runs to Halex",
      "now. We finish this at his door, Warden.\""
    ],
    "lose": [
      "The court holds. Halex watches the assault break against his walls and does not",
      "even rise from his chair."
    ]
  },
